# Input

```svelte
{#each animals as animal}{animal}{/each}

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -1 +1,3 @@
-{#each animals as animal}{animal}{/each}
+{#each animals as animal}
+    {animal}
+{/each}
```

# Output

```svelte
